{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 2141 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "8a67a8cddbeb1ff6c03bf2ada95cfcaa66b849d02a2e7a8387917162b2fd2505" :edb/db-before-t 2140 :edb/db-after-t 2141 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535453 50 #inst "2026-10-09T00:24:09.780Z" 13194139535453 true] [17592186083121 1020 #edb/ref 17592186349944 13194139535453 true] [17592186083209 1020 #edb/ref 17592186349949 13194139535453 true] [17592186083210 1020 #edb/ref 17592186349938 13194139535453 true] [17592186349938 1017 #edb/ref 17592186349939 13194139535453 true] [17592186349938 1017 #edb/ref 17592186349942 13194139535453 true] [17592186349938 1089 "q-328353" 13194139535453 true] [17592186349938 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535453 true] [17592186349938 1100 "The center of the hyperbola $3{x}^{2}-4{y}^{2}-12x+16y=28$ is$\\,\\,($\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}\n$).$" 13194139535453 true] [17592186349938 1113 #uuid "25aaf0a3-1775-57b0-bf67-4610b7f14f89" 13194139535453 true] [17592186349938 1145 "The equation of a horizontal hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTo rewrite the equation of the hyperbola in the above form, we need to group $x$ and $y$ terms and complete the squares, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}^{2}-4{y}^{2}-12x+16y & =28 \\\\ 3{x}^{2}-12x-4{y}^{2}+16y & =28 \\\\ 3[{x}^{2}-4x]-4[{y}^{2}-4y] & =28 \\\\ 3[(x-2)^{2}-4]-4[(y-2)^{2}-4] & =28 \\\\ 3(x-2)^{2}-12-4(y-2)^{2}+16 & =28 \\\\ 3(x-2)^{2}-4(y-2)^{2} & =28+12-16 \\\\ 3(x-2)^{2}-4(y-2)^{2} & =24 \\\\ \\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{8}-\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{6} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{(\\sqrt{8})^{2}}-\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{(\\sqrt{6})^{2}} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the center of the hyperbola is $(\\,2,2\\,).$" 13194139535453 true] [17592186349939 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349940 13194139535453 true] [17592186349939 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349941 13194139535453 true] [17592186349939 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535453 true] [17592186349939 1041 "field-1" 1319413